","merged_at":"2025-01-20T16:16:41Z"},"body":"Using master, setting `CircleShape2D`'s radius to the same value every frame causes a quite big performance hit. \r\n\r\nThere are, of course, many ways to prevent doing this, but quite often, especially prototyping and testing new stuff, the simplest way is just to set the property and to do not care about the previous value. Checking the current property value before changing it or using some sort of flag in GDScript is most likely slower than letting the C++ property guard handle the situation.\r\n\r\n`WorldBoundaryShape2D` already had property guards.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101747/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101747/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}